      "created_at": "2017-01-27T04:42:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>As I wrote over there:</p><div><div>He shuffled a Construct in his deck using PW Captain Cosmic's power, he got a Mechanical Golem from Unity using Scrap Metal through Lemme See That, he used Sky-Scraper's tiny power to get a Link card, and he stole Wrong Time and Place from Setback through Lemme See That because Caspit's Playground is out and on his turn shuffled it into his deck. Outside of Setback's card I only know a keyword used on the card.</div></div><p><span>As to his own card I'm guessing Best Card Ever! or a Look What I Found!</span></p>",
