      "raw": "<p>As I wrote over there:</p><div class=\"commentthread_comment_content\" style=\"color: rgb(172, 178, 184); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><div class=\"commentthread_comment_text\" id=\"comment_content_135507403155832417\" style=\"font-size: 13px; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-y: auto; max-height: 400px; line-height: 18px;\">He shuffled a Construct in his deck using PW Captain Cosmic&#39;s power, he got a Mechanical Golem from Unity using Scrap Metal through Lemme See That, he used Sky-Scraper&#39;s tiny power to get a Link card, and he stole Wrong Time and Place from Setback through Lemme See That because Caspit&#39;s Playground is out and on his turn shuffled it into his deck. Outside of Setback&#39;s card I only know a keyword used on the card.</div></div><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">As to his own card I&#39;m guessing Best Card Ever! or a Look What I Found!</span></p>",
